{"completed": true, "response": "这时，他不是突然才明白自己想要什么，也没有马上决定说出来。和对方的亲近已经让他感到满足，所以他想表达心意，不是因为心里缺了什么，而是因为这段关系很珍贵，他更想让对方知道自己的心意，同时也担心说出口会改变两人的相处。之前的顾虑还在，开心也没有让这些顾虑消失。越觉得这份亲近值得珍惜，他就越想表达，也越在意表达之后可能发生的变化。所以，他的心意比之前更强烈了，却还是没有说出口。正是这种既想靠近、又有所顾虑的心情，让他显得越来越热切，却始终无法安心，不需要再加上什么劝说、想通或下定决心的过程。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2ba9abf2-cbaa-47b9-ae29-ecc31782779c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003242911031Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.282, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:32:50.189571+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a56f7328136fda0fe04b40a1a78a1dbf0105f0ee20bb45da8249b6a10e4f23d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-202